{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CARD STOCK NOTICE (custom vcollect)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Custom addition (not part of Impact core). Shows "Plus que X en stock" on a product card once the product enters the
red zone, the same zone the inventory bar paints red on the product page. Everything renders server-side from data
Liquid already has, so the card costs nothing extra to load.

The quantity shown is the BEST-stocked variant (Lucas's rule): if even the fullest variant is in the red zone, the
product as a whole really is scarce. Summing variants would mix units (a display and a single booster), and taking
the default variant would cry scarcity while another variant still has plenty.

A product with an untracked purchasable variant never shows the notice: untracked means unlimited for sale purposes,
and its inventory_quantity of 0 must not be mistaken for scarcity (same rule as the product page inventory bar).

The coming-soon/pre-order checks run last on purpose: they render two snippets, so only the rare red-zone card pays
for them. An unreleased product without pre-order shows the waitlist button instead of a buy button, and a scarcity
line next to "Me prévenir" would be noise; during an open pre-order the remaining allocation is real, so it shows.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* product: the product to render the notice for (required)
* text_alignment: "center" centers the notice, anything else leaves it left-aligned (optional)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign threshold = settings.card_stock_threshold | default: 0

  assign best_quantity = 0
  assign has_untracked_purchasable = false

  for variant in product.variants
    if variant.inventory_management == blank
      if variant.available
        assign has_untracked_purchasable = true
        break
      endif
    elsif variant.inventory_quantity > best_quantity
      assign best_quantity = variant.inventory_quantity
    endif
  endfor

  assign show_notice = false
  if has_untracked_purchasable == false and best_quantity > 0 and best_quantity <= threshold
    assign show_notice = true
  endif

  if show_notice
    capture is_coming_soon
      render 'coming-soon-check', product: product
    endcapture
    assign is_coming_soon = is_coming_soon | strip

    if is_coming_soon == 'true'
      capture is_pre_order
        render 'pre-order-check', product: product
      endcapture
      assign is_pre_order = is_pre_order | strip

      if is_pre_order != 'true'
        assign show_notice = false
      endif
    endif
  endif
-%}

{%- if show_notice -%}
  <p class="product-card__stock text-sm {% if text_alignment == 'center' %}text-center{% endif %}">
    {{- 'product.general.card_stock_notice' | t: count: best_quantity -}}
  </p>
{%- endif -%}
